#. Global message key: aboutTitle1
#: src/sections/about.html:43
msgctxt "text:aboutTitle1"
msgid "One barrier, seven schools, countless ways to see the world."
msgstr "一つの結界、七つの学部、無数の世界の見方。"

#. Global message key: aboutBody1
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:aboutBody1"
msgid ""
"Touhou University sits inside the Great Barrier, connecting the Human "
"Village, Youkai Mountain, Misty Lake, and the Bamboo Forest. It is a place "
"where people with different lifespans, abilities, and common sense build "
"methods they can share."
msgstr "幻想郷立東方大学は大結界の内側に位置し、人里、妖怪の山、霧の湖、迷いの竹林を結びます。違いを隔てるのではなく、異なる寿命・能力・常識をもつ者が共有できる方法を築く場所です。"

#. Global message key: aboutBody2
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:aboutBody2"
msgid ""
"Incidents, legends, and everyday life are serious subjects of research here. "
"Every form of knowledge must answer who may use it, who bears the risk, and "
"how its findings will serve Gensokyo."
msgstr "異変、伝承、日常生活を真剣な研究課題として扱い、すべての知に「誰が使い、誰が危険を負い、成果をどう幻想郷へ返すか」を問いかけます。"

#. Global message key: schoolsCount
#: src/sections/about.html:48
msgctxt "text:schoolsCount"
msgid "Schools"
msgstr "学部 / Schools"

#. Global message key: traditionsEyebrow
#: src/sections/traditions.html:5
msgctxt "text:traditionsEyebrow"
msgid "IDENTITY / MOTTO & TRADITIONS"
msgstr "IDENTITY / 校訓と伝統"

#. Global message key: motto1
#: src/sections/traditions.html:6
msgctxt "text:motto1"
msgid "Cross borders in pursuit of truth;"
msgstr "境を越えて真を求め、"

#. Global message key: motto2
#: src/sections/traditions.html:6
msgctxt "text:motto2"
msgid "contest ideas with respect."
msgstr "礼をもって競い合う。"

#. Global message key: mottoBody
#: src/sections/about.html:21
msgctxt "text:mottoBody"
msgid ""
"A barrier is not the end of knowledge. Every crossing must leave behind "
"traceable observations and a clear account of responsibility."
msgstr "結界を知の終点としない。越境のたびに、追跡できる観察と責任を残す。"

#. Global message key: uniformName
#: src/sections/traditions.html:38
