msgid "Ink Navy & Vermilion Cord"
msgstr "墨紺と朱縄"

#. Global message key: uniformBody
#: src/sections/traditions.html:39
msgctxt "text:uniformBody"
msgid ""
"Winter uniform begins at the start of winter; field-course adaptations are "
"available for species and ability needs."
msgstr "冬服は立冬に衣替え。実地授業では種族と能力に応じた機能改修を申請できます。"

#. Global message key: anniversary
#: src/sections/traditions.html:50
msgctxt "text:anniversary"
msgid "Anniversary · Boundary Founding Festival"
msgstr "大学祭・境界開学祭"

#. Global message key: anniversaryBody
#: src/sections/traditions.html:51
msgctxt "text:anniversaryBody"
msgid "One day each year, every campus gate leads to the same square."
msgstr "一年に一日だけ、すべての校門が同じ広場へ通じます。"

