#. Global message key: chroniclePortalTitle
#: src/sections/traditions.html:69
msgctxt "text:chroniclePortalTitle"
msgid "When the version changes, history must gain a page."
msgstr "版が変われば、大学史にも一頁増える。"

#. Global message key: chroniclePortalLead
#: src/sections/traditions.html:70
msgctxt "text:chroniclePortalLead"
msgid ""
"The Hieda archive turns real version subjects into university history, "
"preserving corrections, disputes, and objections from those involved."
msgstr "実際の版主題を稗田史学館が大学史へ編入し、訂正・係争・当事者の抗議も併せて保存します。"

#. Global message key: chronicleLatest
