msgid "Any format, up to 1,000 characters; fairies may submit images or a field demonstration."
msgstr "形式自由・千字以内。妖精は図像または実地実演で代替可。"

#. Global message key: spellNote
#: src/sections/admissions.html:60
msgctxt "text:spellNote"
msgid ""
"An academic contest with a name, rules, and a way out; firepower does not "
"decide admission."
msgstr "名称・規則・退路のある学術的勝負。火力で合否は決めない。"

