#. Global message key: aboutActual
#: src/sections/about.html:7
msgctxt "text:aboutActual"
msgid ""
"Touhou University of Gensokyo is a research university crossing species, "
"regions, and common sense. Hieda records, terakoya history, magicians' "
"experiments, Eientei medicine, kappa engineering, and tengu journalism meet "
"at one table to test conflicting views."
msgstr ""
"幻想郷立東方大学は、種族・地域・常識を越える研究大学です。稗田家の記録、寺子屋の歴史、魔法使いの実験、永遠亭の医薬、河童の工学、天狗の新聞という知の伝統"
"を出発点に、対立する視点を同じ机で検証します。"

#. Global message key: keineTags
#: src/sections/academics.html:30
