msgid "It starts when you cross the gate."
msgstr "門をくぐった瞬間から。"

#. Global message key: academicLead
#: src/sections/academics.html:8
msgctxt "text:academicLead"
msgid ""
"From boundary governance to lunar pharmacology, every discipline must answer "
"one question: how will this knowledge change shared life in Gensokyo?"
msgstr "境界統治から月都薬理まで、すべての学問が同じ問いに答えます。この知識は幻想郷の共同生活をどう変えるのか。"

#. Global message key: campusLead
#: src/sections/campus.html:8
msgctxt "text:campusLead"
msgid ""
"From Misty Lake study to Youkai Mountain fieldwork and the annual spell-card "
"lantern festival, campus is not a barrier from difference but a place to "
"learn how to live together."
msgstr "霧の湖での自習、妖怪の山での実習、年に一度のスペルカード灯会。キャンパスは違いを避ける結界ではなく、共に生きる方法を学ぶ場所です。"

#. Global message key: bbsCoursePost2
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:bbsCoursePost2"
msgid "Does Professor Keine take attendance in Source Criticism—and does it enter history?"
msgstr "慧音先生の史料批判は出席を取りますか？それも歴史に残りますか？"

#. Global message key: researchReportsBody
#: src/sections/research.html:70
msgctxt "text:researchReportsBody"
msgid ""
"News, village testimony, and participant records teach students to identify "
"narrative position and silence."
msgstr "新聞、里の口述、当事者記録を並べ、語りの位置と沈黙を見分けます。"

